"\n"
"配备有限次使用的消音器。消音器最终会损耗，请谨慎使用。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000042
msgid ""
"A miniature light machine gun developed for Special Forces use, notable for its extremely compact, highly portable design.\n"
"\n"
"The M10's extremely high rate of fire allows the user to pelt the target with a barrage of well-placed shots, giving it impressive stopping power. This power comes at the expense of accuracy, however, as the gun's small size is ill-balanced against its high recoil.\n"
"\n"
"It takes a great deal of practice to bring out this submachine gun's full capabilities; the best approach is to keep using it until you are thoroughly familiar with how it handles. \n"
"\n"
"This model is fitted with a barrel jacket, slightly increasing the weight and shifting the center of gravity forward. The effect is to reduce muzzle jump, improving the gun's firing accuracy."
msgstr ""
"为特种部队研制的微型轻机枪，以极其紧凑、高度便携的设计著称。\n"
"\n"
"M10极高的射速让使用者能以密集而精准的弹雨压制目标，拥有惊人的停止作用。但这份威力以精度为代价，枪身小巧却后坐力巨大，平衡性不佳。\n"
"\n"
"要发挥这把冲锋枪的全部性能需要大量练习；最好的办法就是不断使用，直到彻底熟悉它的手感。\n"
"\n"
"此型号装有枪管护套，略微增加重量并将重心前移。效果是减少枪口上跳，提升射击精度。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000043
msgid ""
"A submachine gun created as an offshoot of the G3, the mainstay rifle of the West German military. It uses European standard 9mm ammo with more or less average firepower.\n"
"\n"
"Unlike most submachine guns, the MP5A2 uses a closed-bolt firing mechanism, which puts it a cut above its competitors in terms of accuracy. This higher accuracy allows for precision targeting of specific body parts at a greater distance than other submachine guns, giving it an almost assault rifle-like feel. A solid choice for close- to mid-range combat."
msgstr ""
"作为西德军队主力步枪G3衍生型开发的冲锋枪。使用欧洲标准9mm弹药，火力大致中等。\n"
"\n"
"与多数冲锋枪不同，MP5A2采用闭膛待击结构，精度优于同类。凭借更高的精度，可在比其他冲锋枪更远的距离精确瞄准特定部位，手感接近突击步枪。中近距离作战的可靠选择。"

