"\n"
"本型号内置消音器，消音效果不会损耗。\n"
"\n"
"与多数冲锋枪不同，MP5SD2采用闭膛待击结构，精度优于同类。凭借更高的精度，可在比其他冲锋枪更远的距离精确瞄准特定部位，手感接近突击步枪。中近距离作战的可靠选择。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000046
msgid ""
"A Czechoslovakia-made submachine gun developed as a self-defense weapon for vehicle crews. Its ultra-compact design is tailored for use in cramped vehicle compartments.\n"
"\n"
"The Uz61's small frame makes it incredibly easy to handle and a wide effective AUTO AIM range. While it boasts low recoil and a relatively high rate of fire, its ammunition is rather underpowered, requiring multiple shots and a careful aim to be effective."
msgstr ""
"捷克斯洛伐克制造的冲锋枪，作为车组人员的自卫武器而研制。其超紧凑设计专为狭窄的车内空间打造。\n"
"\n"
"Uz61枪身小巧，极其易于操控，自动瞄准范围广。虽然后坐力低、射速相对较高，但弹药威力不足，需多次命中并仔细瞄准才能见效。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000047
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000048
msgid ""
"A Czechoslovakia-made submachine gun developed as a self-defense weapon for vehicle crews. Its ultra-compact design is tailored for use in cramped vehicle compartments.\n"
"\n"
"The Uz61's small frame makes it incredibly easy to handle and gives it a wide AUTO AIM range. While it boasts low recoil and a relatively high rate of fire, its ammunition is rather underpowered, requiring multiple shots and a careful aim to be effective.\n"
"\n"
"Equipped with a limited-use suppressor. The suppressor will eventually wear out, so use it prudently."
msgstr ""
"捷克斯洛伐克制造的冲锋枪，作为车组人员的自卫武器而研制。其超紧凑设计专为狭窄的车内空间打造。\n"
