"The M16A1 uses small-caliber, low-recoil ammunition, and as a result its firing accuracy is truly impressive.\n"
"\n"
"A smoke grenade launcher has been added to this model, which not only increases its direct attack power but also degrades the enemy's ability to track and engage targets, resulting in a much more versatile weapon."
msgstr ""
"美国陆军研制的一款先进轻型突击步枪，摒弃了传统大口径步兵步枪的路线。因其枪身多为塑料材质呈黑色，又被称为“黑枪”。它在越南战争中声名鹊起，以优异性能打出了名号。\n"
"\n"
"M16A1使用小口径低后坐力弹药，因此射击精度极为出色。\n"
"\n"
"此型号加装了烟雾弹发射器，不仅提升直接攻击力，还能削弱敌人追踪和交战目标的能力，使武器用途更加多样。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000058
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000059
msgid ""
"An advanced, lightweight assault rifle developed by the U.S. Army in a departure from the traditional large-caliber infantry rifle. Also known as the \"black rifle\" due to the color of its frame, which is largely made of plastic. Notable for its use in the Vietnam War, where it made a name for itself with its superior performance.\n"
"\n"
"The M16A1 uses small-caliber, low-recoil ammunition, and as a result its firing accuracy is truly impressive.\n"
"\n"
"A smoke grenade launcher has been added to this model, which not only increases its direct attack power but also degrades the enemy's ability to track and engage targets, resulting in a much more versatile weapon.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"The addition of a laser sight allows for easier targeting."
msgstr ""
"美国陆军研制的一款先进轻型突击步枪，摒弃了传统大口径步兵步枪的路线。因其枪身多为塑料材质呈黑色，又被称为“黑枪”。它在越南战争中声名鹊起，以优异性能打出了名号。\n"
"\n"
"M16A1使用小口径低后坐力弹药，因此射击精度极为出色。\n"
"\n"
"此型号加装了烟雾弹发射器，不仅提升直接攻击力，还能削弱敌人追踪和交战目标的能力，使武器用途更加多样。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"加装激光瞄准器，更易瞄准。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00005c
msgid ""
"A carbine offshoot of the M16, developed for use by commandos. It takes the superior capabilities of the original M16 and puts them into a lighter, more compact package. These qualities make it ideal for extended solo missions; as such, it is the weapon of choice for many Special Forces units.\n"
"\n"
"The M653's easy handling allows for a more stable aim, resulting in a high firing accuracy. "
msgstr ""
"M16的卡宾衍生型号，为突击队员研制。它继承了原版M16的优异性能，并装入更轻、更紧凑的枪身。这些特质使其非常适合长时间单独任务；因此成为许多特种部队的首选武器。\n"
"\n"
"M653易于操控，瞄准更稳定，射击精度高。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00005d
msgid ""
"A carbine offshoot of the M16, developed for use by commandos. It takes the superior capabilities of the original M16 and puts them into a lighter, more compact package. These qualities make it ideal for extended solo missions; as such, it is the weapon of choice for many Special Forces units.\n"
"\n"
"The M653's easy handling allows for a more stable aim, resulting in a high firing accuracy. \n"
"\n"
"Equipped with a limited-use suppressor. The suppressor will eventually wear out, so use it prudently."
msgstr ""
"M16的卡宾衍生型号，为突击队员研制。它继承了原版M16的优异性能，并装入更轻、更紧凑的枪身。这些特质使其非常适合长时间单独任务；因此成为许多特种部队的首选武器。\n"
"\n"
"M653易于操控，瞄准更稳定，射击精度高。\n"
"\n"
"配备有限次使用的消音器。消音器最终会损耗，请谨慎使用。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00005e
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00005f
msgid ""
"A carbine offshoot of the M16, developed for use by commandos. It takes the superior capabilities of the original M16 and puts them into a lighter, more compact package. These qualities make it ideal for extended solo missions; as such, it is the weapon of choice for many Special Forces units.\n"
"\n"
"The M653's easy handling allows for a more stable aim, resulting in a high firing accuracy. \n"
"\n"
"A grenade launcher has been added to this model, improving its performance in combat against groups of enemies and larger, armored targets."
msgstr ""
"M16的卡宾衍生型号，为突击队员研制。它继承了原版M16的优异性能，并装入更轻、更紧凑的枪身。这些特质使其非常适合长时间单独任务；因此成为许多特种部队的首选武器。\n"
"\n"
"M653易于操控，瞄准更稳定，射击精度高。\n"
"\n"
"此型号加装了榴弹发射器，提升了对成群敌人和大型装甲目标的作战能力。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000060
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000061
msgid ""
"A carbine offshoot of the M16, developed for use by commandos. It takes the superior capabilities of the original M16 and puts them into a lighter, more compact package. These qualities make it ideal for extended solo missions; as such, it is the weapon of choice for many Special Forces units.\n"
"\n"
"The M653's easy handling allows for a more stable aim, resulting in a high firing accuracy. \n"
"\n"
"This model has been modified with an extra underbarrel shotgun, greatly increasing its firepower and making it an effective weapon against both close- and long-range targets."
msgstr ""
"M16的卡宾衍生型号，为突击队员研制。它继承了原版M16的优异性能，并装入更轻、更紧凑的枪身。这些特质使其非常适合长时间单独任务；因此成为许多特种部队的首选武器。\n"
"\n"
"M653易于操控，瞄准更稳定，射击精度高。\n"
"\n"
"此型号加装了枪挂霰弹枪，大幅提升火力，对近距离和远距离目标都有效。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000062
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000063
msgid ""
"A carbine offshoot of the M16, developed for use by commandos. It takes the superior capabilities of the original M16 and puts them into a lighter, more compact package. These qualities make it ideal for extended solo missions; as such, it is the weapon of choice for many Special Forces units.\n"
"\n"
"The M653's easy handling allows for a more stable aim, resulting in a high firing accuracy. \n"
"\n"
"A smoke grenade launcher has been added to this model, which not only increases its direct attack power but also degrades the enemy's ability to track and engage targets, resulting in a much more versatile weapon."
msgstr ""
"M16的卡宾枪衍生型，为突击队开发。它继承了M16的优异性能，同时更轻便紧凑。这些特点使其非常适合长时间单独任务，因此成为许多特种部队的制式武器。\n"
"\n"
"M653易于操控，瞄准更稳定，射击精度高。\n"
"\n"
"此型号加装了发烟弹发射器，不仅提升了直接攻击力，还能削弱敌人追踪和锁定目标的能力，是一把用途广泛的武器。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000064
msgid ""
"The primary infantry assault rifle of the Soviet Union, rival superpower to the United States. Supplied by the Soviets to satellite states, allies, and communist revolutionary movements alike, this gun has become the \"poster child\" for armed conflict worldwide.\n"
"\n"
"The RK47 is both sturdy and lightweight, but above all its design emphasizes reliability. It uses large-caliber, high-recoil ammo, rendering it somewhat less accurate than its rival the M16. That said, when you need to stop an enemy advance in a hurry, the AK's heavy-hitting firepower can be a godsend."
msgstr ""
"美国劲敌苏联的主力步兵突击步枪。苏联将其供应给卫星国、盟友及各国共产主义革命运动，这把枪已成为全球武装冲突的“形象代言人”。\n"
"\n"
"RK47坚固轻便，但最重要的是设计上强调可靠性。它使用大口径高后坐力弹药，精度不如劲敌M16。但当你急需阻止敌人推进时，AK的沉重火力堪称天赐之物。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000065
msgid ""
"The primary infantry assault rifle of the Soviet Union, rival superpower to the United States. Supplied by the Soviets to satellite states, allies, and communist revolutionary movements alike, this gun has become the \"poster child\" for armed conflict worldwide.\n"
"\n"
"The RK47 is both sturdy and lightweight, but above all its design emphasizes reliability. It uses large-caliber, high-recoil ammo, rendering it somewhat less accurate than its rival the M16. That said, when you need to stop an enemy advance in a hurry, the AK's heavy-hitting firepower can be a godsend.\n"
"\n"
"A grenade launcher has been added to this model, improving its performance in combat against groups of enemies and larger, armored targets."
msgstr ""
"美国劲敌苏联的主力步兵突击步枪。苏联将其供应给卫星国、盟友及各国共产主义革命运动，这把枪已成为全球武装冲突的“形象代言人”。\n"
"\n"
"RK47坚固轻便，但最重要的是设计上强调可靠性。它使用大口径高后坐力弹药，精度不如劲敌M16。但当你急需阻止敌人推进时，AK的沉重火力堪称天赐之物。\n"
"\n"
"此型号加装了榴弹发射器，提升了对成群敌人和大型装甲目标的作战能力。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000066
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00006a
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00006b
msgid ""
"A carbine version of the ADM63, it features a more lightweight design created with airborne and commando units in mind. It is fitted with a large muzzle compensator for improved firing accuracy.\n"
"\n"
"The ADM65 is a hidden masterpiece, deftly balancing stopping power with precision and accuracy. Exactly the kind of weapon you want to have with you on a sneaking mission."
msgstr ""
"ADM63的卡宾枪版本，设计更轻便，专为空降和突击部队打造。它配备大型枪口补偿器以提升射击精度。\n"
"\n"
"ADM65是一件隐秘的杰作，巧妙平衡了停止作用与精准度。正是潜行任务中你想要随身携带的那种武器。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000067
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000068
msgid ""
"The primary infantry assault rifle of the Soviet Union, rival superpower to the United States. Supplied by the Soviets to satellite states, allies, and communist revolutionary movements alike, this gun has become the \"poster child\" for armed conflict worldwide.\n"
"\n"
"The RK47 is both sturdy and lightweight, but above all its design emphasizes reliability. It uses large-caliber, high-recoil ammo, rendering it somewhat less accurate than its rival the M16. That said, when you need to stop an enemy advance in a hurry, the RK's heavy-hitting firepower can be a godsend.\n"
"\n"
"A smoke grenade launcher has been added to this model, which not only increases its direct attack power but also degrades the enemy's ability to track and engage targets, resulting in a much more versatile weapon."
msgstr ""
"美国劲敌苏联的主力步兵突击步枪。苏联将其供应给卫星国、盟友及各国共产主义革命运动，这把枪已成为全球武装冲突的“形象代言人”。\n"
"\n"
"RK47坚固轻便，但最重要的是设计上强调可靠性。它使用大口径高后坐力弹药，精度不如劲敌M16。但当你急需阻止敌人推进时，RK的沉重火力堪称天赐之物。\n"
"\n"
"此型号加装了发烟弹发射器，不仅提升了直接攻击力，还能削弱敌人追踪和锁定目标的能力，是一把用途广泛的武器。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000069
msgid ""
"A modified version of the RK47 produced at the request of the Romanian military. The grip is attached to the forestock, giving it improved controllability compared to the original RK during sustained fire.\n"
"\n"
"The ADM63 uses the same ammo as the RK and is equally effective at stopping targets in their tracks. A good addition to your arsenal if you anticipate facing an enemy charge."
msgstr ""
"应罗马尼亚军方要求生产的RK47改良版。握把与前护木相连，持续射击时可控性优于原版RK。\n"
"\n"
"ADM63使用与RK相同的弹药，同样能有效阻止目标行动。若预料会遭遇敌军冲锋，这是你武器库中的好选择。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00006c
msgid ""
"A light machine gun (squad support weapon) designed as an modified, expanded version of the RK47. It is similar in performance to the RK, but delivers greater firepower and more reliable operation at the cost of lower accuracy.  It has a longer barrel than the RK, which somewhat reduces shaking during sustained fire. Think of it as a slight heavier, more precise RK.\n"
"\n"
"When choosing whether to carry an RK or an RPK, consider the tradeoff between ease of handling and firing accuracy and pick the best gun for your needs."
msgstr ""
"一种轻机枪（班组支援武器），由RK47改良扩展而成。性能与RK相似，但火力更强、运作更可靠，代价是精度较低。枪管比RK更长，能在一定程度上减少持续射击时的抖动。可视为略重、更精准的RK。\n"
"\n"
"在选择携带RK还是RPK时，请权衡操控性与射击精度，挑选最适合你需要的那把枪。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00006d
msgid ""
"A light machine gun (squad support weapon) designed as an modified, expanded version of the RK47. It is similar in performance to the RK, but delivers greater firepower and more reliable operation at the cost of lower accuracy.  It has a longer barrel than the RK, which somewhat reduces shaking during sustained fire. Think of it as a slight heavier, more precise RK.\n"
"\n"
"When choosing whether to carry an RK or an RPK, consider the tradeoff between ease of handling and firing accuracy and pick the best gun for your needs.\n"
"\n"
"This model has been modified to accommodate a drum magazine, significantly boosting its ammo capacity. Hence, it does not need to be reloaded as often, giving it a tactical advantage over models that use standard magazines."
msgstr ""
"一种轻机枪（班组支援武器），由RK47改良扩展而成。性能与RK相似，但火力更强、运作更可靠，代价是精度较低。枪管比RK更长，能在一定程度上减少持续射击时的抖动。可视为略重、更精准的RK。\n"
"\n"
"在选择携带RK还是RPK时，请权衡操控性与射击精度，挑选最适合你需要的那把枪。\n"
"\n"
"此型号经过改装以适配弹鼓，大幅提升弹药容量。因此无需频繁装弹，相比使用标准弹匣的型号具有战术优势。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00006e
msgid ""
"A high-performance assault rifle, one of the two mainstays of the West alongside the M16. Solid, powerful, and reliable, the FAL is a very well-rounded weapon. Its chief drawbacks are its large size,  which makes it a bit unwieldy, and the high recoil produced by its high-powered ammunition, which makes it difficult to control during sustained fire.\n"
"\n"
"The FAL's highly precise aim allows for AUTO AIM over a wide angle. It is versatile enough to provide stopping power from a distance while still holding its own in a sudden gun battle at close range. "
msgstr ""
"高性能突击步枪，与M16并列为西方两大主力。坚固、强力、可靠，FAL是一把非常均衡的武器。主要缺点是其体积庞大，略显笨重，以及高能弹药带来的高后坐力，持续射击时难以控制。\n"
"\n"
"FAL瞄准精度极高，可在较大角度内自动瞄准。它用途广泛，既能远距离提供停止作用，也能在近距离突发枪战中不落下风。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00006f
msgid ""
"A high-performance assault rifle, one of the two mainstays of the West alongside the M16. Solid, powerful, and reliable, the FAL is a very well-rounded weapon. Its chief drawbacks are its large size,  which makes it a bit unwieldy, and the high recoil produced by its high-powered ammunition, which makes it difficult to control during sustained fire.\n"
"\n"
"The FAL's highly precise aim allows for AUTO AIM over a wide angle. This model has also been modified with a shorter barrel for better handling, making it an even more effective weapon in close-range combat."
msgstr ""
"高性能突击步枪，与M16并列为西方两大主力。坚固、强力、可靠，FAL是一把非常均衡的武器。主要缺点是其体积庞大，略显笨重，以及高能弹药带来的高后坐力，持续射击时难以控制。\n"
"\n"
"FAL瞄准精度极高，可在较大角度内自动瞄准。此型号还改装了短枪管以提升操控性，使其在近距离作战中更加有效。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000070
msgid ""
"A high-performance assault rifle, one of the two mainstays of the West alongside the M16. Solid, powerful, and reliable, the FAL is a very well-rounded weapon. Its chief drawbacks are its large size,  which makes it a bit unwieldy, and the high recoil produced by its high-powered ammunition, which makes it difficult to control during sustained fire.\n"
"\n"
"The FAL's highly precise aim allows for AUTO AIM over a wide angle. This model has also been fitted with a laser sight, making it quick to aim and even more effective in long-range gun battles."
msgstr ""
"高性能突击步枪，与M16并列为西方两大主力。坚固、强力、可靠，FAL是一把非常均衡的武器。主要缺点是其体积庞大，略显笨重，以及高能弹药带来的高后坐力，持续射击时难以控制。\n"
"\n"
"FAL瞄准精度极高，可在较大角度内自动瞄准。此型号还配备了激光瞄准器，瞄准迅速，在远距离枪战中更加有效。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000071
msgid ""
"A newcomer to the assault rifle field. Most of its main components are made of plastic, and it features an advanced bullpup design with the action mechanism situated behind the grip.\n"
"\n"
"Design-wise, its compact size makes the SUG easy to handle and recoil easier to absorb. However, it is somewhat lacking in power since it uses the same ammo as the M16.\n"
"\n"
"The SUG is easy to control during sustained fire due to its low recoil, improving the user's ability to concentrate fire into a target's vital areas and thus boosting the chances of scoring a critical hit."
msgstr ""
"突击步枪领域的新秀。主要部件大多采用塑料制造，并采用先进的无托设计，枪机位于握把后方。\n"
"\n"
"设计上，紧凑的尺寸使SUG易于操控，后坐力也更容易吸收。不过由于使用与M16相同的弹药，威力稍显不足。\n"
"\n"
"SUG后坐力低，持续射击时易于控制，能提升射手将火力集中于目标要害部位的能力，从而增加打出暴击的几率。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000072
msgid ""
"A prototype assault rifle currently in development as the next generation of infantry weapon. It uses a newly developed \"caseless\" ammunition whose rounds do not require a metal case.\n"
"\n"
"The new ammo makes the G11 incredibly easy to control due to its extremely low recoil. The downside to this is that the bullets themselves are not that powerful. Thus, the key to using the G11 is carefully aiming shots to ensure they hit their intended targets.\n"
"\n"
"The G11's snag-free style allows it to be equipped without reducing the camo index significantly, making it well-suited to sneaking missions."
msgstr ""
"作为下一代步兵武器正在开发中的试验型突击步枪。它使用新研发的“无壳”弹药，弹丸无需金属弹壳。\n"
"\n"
"新弹药后坐力极低，使G11极易操控。缺点是弹丸本身威力不大。因此，使用G11的关键在于仔细瞄准，确保命中预定目标。\n"
"\n"
"G11的无挂绊造型使其装备时不会大幅降低迷彩指数，非常适合潜行任务。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000073
msgid ""
"A surviving relic of the age of the samurai, distinguished by its handsome wood finish.\n"
"\n"
"While clearly ill-suited for modern warfare, there have been reports of mysterious things happening from time to time when the Tanegashima hits its mark.\n"
"\n"
"The most stoic of players might find a place for this in their arsenals...or not."
msgstr ""
"武士时代的遗存，以精美的木质外观著称。\n"
"\n"
"虽然显然不适合现代战争，但时有报告称种子岛命中目标时会发生神秘现象。\n"
"\n"
"最能忍耐的玩家或许会在武器库中为它留个位置……也可能不会。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000089
msgid "A general purpose machine gun used by the U.S. military and many of its Western allies. It is fed by a 100-round belt-link bandolier, giving it long-lasting firepower in a fight.  However, the weight of this ammo, combined with the weight of the gun itself, makes the M60 difficult to handle. Its true value is in pitched gun battles where the enemy is some distance away."
msgstr "美国军方及其众多西方盟友使用的通用机枪。由100发弹链供弹，能在战斗中提供持久火力。然而弹药重量加上枪身重量，使M60难以操控。它的真正价值在于敌人距离较远的激烈枪战。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00008a
msgid ""
"A general purpose machine gun used by the U.S. military and many of its Western allies. It is fed by a 100-round belt-link bandolier, giving it long-lasting firepower in a fight.  However, the weight of this ammo, combined with the weight of the gun itself, makes the M60 difficult to handle. Its true value is in pitched gun battles where the enemy is some distance away.\n"
"\n"
"Modified to fire armor-piercing rounds, increasing its ability to take down heavily protected targets."
msgstr ""
"美军及其许多西方盟国使用的通用机枪。它由100发弹链供弹，可在战斗中提供持久火力。然而，弹药重量加上枪身重量，使M60难以操控。它真正的价值在于与敌人有一定距离的激烈枪战中。\n"
"\n"
"经过改装以发射穿甲弹，提高了击倒重装甲目标的能力。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00008b
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00008c
msgid ""
"A general purpose machine gun used by the U.S. military and many of its Western allies. It is fed by a 200-round belt-link bandolier, giving it long-lasting firepower in a fight.  However, the weight of this ammo, combined with the weight of the gun itself, makes the M60 difficult to handle. Its true value is in pitched gun battles where the enemy is some distance away.\n"
"\n"
"This model has been fitted with a shorter barrel, making it easier to handle and more user-friendly in close-range combat."
msgstr ""
"美军及其许多西方盟国使用的通用机枪。它由200发弹链供弹，可在战斗中提供持久火力。然而，弹药重量加上枪身重量，使M60难以操控。它真正的价值在于与敌人有一定距离的激烈枪战中。\n"
"\n"
"此型号配备了较短的枪管，使其更易于操控，在近距离战斗中更加方便使用。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00008d
msgid ""
"The M63A1 is a weapons system designed so that it can easily be converted into several different types of weapons - a carbine, an assault rifle, a light machine gun, etc. - using the same set of main components. This is the light machine gun variant.\n"
"\n"
"Amazingly light for a machine gun, it ranks top in its class for ease of handling. Moreover, its armor-piercing ammunition gives it plenty of firepower. All in all, an incredibly useful weapon that acts like a machine gun but feels like an assault rifle."
msgstr ""
"M63A1是一种武器系统，设计上可使用同一套主要部件轻松转换为多种不同类型的武器——卡宾枪、突击步枪、轻机枪等。这是轻机枪型号。\n"
"\n"
"作为机枪而言轻得惊人，在易操控性方面位居同类之首。此外，其穿甲弹药赋予它充足的火力。总而言之，这是一款极其有用的武器，性能像机枪，手感却像突击步枪。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00008e
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00008f
msgid ""
"The M63A1 is a weapons system designed so that it can easily be converted into several different types of weapons - a carbine, an assault rifle, a light machine gun, etc. - using the same set of main components. This is the light machine gun variant.\n"
"\n"
"Amazingly light for a machine gun, it ranks top in its class for ease of handling. Moreover, its armor-piercing ammunition gives it plenty of firepower. All in all, an incredibly useful weapon that acts like a machine gun but feels like an assault rifle.\n"
"\n"
"This model features a shortened barrel for even better handling. The resulting combination of firepower and portability makes it an even easier weapon to use."
msgstr ""
"M63A1是一种武器系统，设计上可使用同一套主要部件轻松转换为多种不同类型的武器——卡宾枪、突击步枪、轻机枪等。这是轻机枪型号。\n"
"\n"
"作为机枪而言轻得惊人，在易操控性方面位居同类之首。此外，其穿甲弹药赋予它充足的火力。总而言之，这是一款极其有用的武器，性能像机枪，手感却像突击步枪。\n"
"\n"
"此型号采用缩短的枪管，操控性更佳。由此形成的火力与便携性组合，使其成为更易于使用的武器。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000090
msgid ""
"The primary general purpose machine gun of the Soviet army. It is sturdy and dependable, but its weight makes it awkward to wield.\n"
"\n"
"The PKM is belt-fed and has a high ammo capacity; it can thus deliver a steady barrage of firepower for a considerable length of time. The gun's superior performance makes it a good weapon for both solo combat and supporting fire in CO-OPS."
msgstr ""
"苏军的主要通用机枪。它坚固可靠，但重量使其难以操控。\n"
"\n"
"PKM采用弹链供弹，弹药容量高；因此能在相当长的时间内持续输出稳定火力。该枪的卓越性能使其成为单兵作战和合作模式中支援火力的良好武器。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000091
msgid ""
"The primary general purpose machine gun of the Soviet army. It is sturdy and dependable, but its weight makes it awkward to wield.\n"
"\n"
"The PKM is belt-fed and has a high ammo capacity; it can thus deliver a steady barrage of firepower for a considerable length of time. The gun's superior performance makes it a good choice for both solo fighters and support troops in CO-OPS.\n"
"\n"
"This model has been modified to increase its ammo capacity, further augmenting its repeat fire capability."
msgstr ""
"苏军的主要通用机枪。它坚固可靠，但重量使其难以操控。\n"
"\n"
"PKM采用弹链供弹，弹药容量高；因此能在相当长的时间内持续输出稳定火力。该枪的卓越性能使其成为单兵作战者和合作模式中支援部队的良好选择。\n"
"\n"
"此型号经过改装以增加弹药容量，进一步增强了其连发能力。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000092
msgid ""
"The primary general purpose machine gun of the Soviet army. It is sturdy and dependable, but its weight makes it awkward to wield.\n"
"\n"
"The PKM is belt-fed and has a high ammo capacity; it can thus deliver a steady barrage of firepower for a considerable length of time. The gun's superior performance makes it a good choice for both solo fighters and support troops in CO-OPS."
msgstr ""
"苏军的主要通用机枪。它坚固可靠，但重量使其难以操控。\n"
"\n"
"PKM采用弹链供弹，弹药容量高；因此能在相当长的时间内持续输出稳定火力。该枪的卓越性能使其成为单兵作战者和合作模式中支援部队的良好选择。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000093
msgid ""
"The primary general purpose machine gun of the Soviet army. It is sturdy and dependable, but its weight makes it awkward to wield.\n"
"\n"
"The PKM is belt-fed and has a high ammo capacity; it can thus deliver a steady barrage of firepower for a considerable length of time. The gun's superior performance makes it a good choice for both solo fighters and support troops in CO-OPS.\n"
"\n"
"This model has been modified to increase its ammo capacity. In fact, it has the highest ammo capacity of any machine gun. A trigger-happy player's dream."
msgstr ""
"苏军的主要通用机枪。它坚固可靠，但重量使其难以操控。\n"
"\n"
"PKM采用弹链供弹，弹药容量高；因此能在相当长的时间内持续输出稳定火力。该枪的卓越性能使其成为单兵作战者和合作模式中支援部队的良好选择。\n"
"\n"
"此型号经过改装以增加弹药容量。事实上，它拥有所有机枪中最高的弹药容量。喜欢扣扳机扣个不停的玩家的梦想。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000094
msgid ""
"The primary general purpose machine gun of the Soviet army. It is sturdy and dependable, but its weight makes it awkward to wield.\n"
"\n"
"The PKM is belt-fed and has a high ammo capacity; it can thus deliver a steady barrage of firepower for a considerable length of time. The gun's superior performance makes it a good choice for both solo fighters and support troops in CO-OPS.\n"
"\n"
"The barrel has been replaced with a shorter version so that poor handling is somewhat less of an issue. Give it a shot in close-range combat - you may be pleasantly surprised."
msgstr ""
"苏军的主要通用机枪。它坚固可靠，但重量使其难以操控。\n"
"\n"
"PKM采用弹链供弹，弹药容量高；因此能在相当长的时间内持续输出稳定火力。该枪的卓越性能使其成为单兵作战者和合作模式中支援部队的良好选择。\n"
"\n"
"枪管已更换为较短的版本，使操控性差的问题有所缓解。在近距离战斗中试一试——你可能会惊喜不已。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000095
msgid ""
"A general purpose machine gun used by the West German armed forces. It is a modified version of the vaunted WW2-era MG42, with a refurbished chamber to accommodate standard post-war ammunition.\n"
"\n"
"The MG3's high rate of fire allows the user to pump dozens of bullets into a target at once. This firepower naturally comes at the price of high recoil, making it extremely hard to control during repeat fire.\n"
"\n"
"Novice players are advised to avoid this weapon until they are skilled enough to handle it."
msgstr ""
"西德武装部队使用的通用机枪。它是备受赞誉的二战时期MG42的改进版，枪膛经过翻新以适配战后标准弹药。\n"
"\n"
"MG3的高射速使用户能一次向目标倾泻数十发子弹。这种火力自然以高后坐力为代价，使其在连发时极难控制。\n"
"\n"
"建议新手玩家在技术足够娴熟、能够驾驭该武器之前避免使用。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000096
msgid ""
"A general purpose machine gun used by the West German armed forces. It is a modified version of the vaunted WW2-era MG42, with a refurbished chamber to accommodate standard post-war ammunition.\n"
"\n"
"The MG3's high rate of fire allows the user to pump dozens of bullets into a target at once. This firepower naturally comes at the price of high recoil, making it extremely hard to control during repeat fire.\n"
"\n"
"Novice players are advised to avoid this weapon until they are skilled enough to handle it.\n"
"\n"
"Modified to fire armor-piercing rounds, further increasing its effectiveness as a weapon system."
msgstr ""
"西德武装部队使用的通用机枪。它是二战时期备受赞誉的MG42的改进型，弹膛经过翻新以适配战后标准弹药。\n"
"\n"
"MG3的高射速能让使用者瞬间将数十发子弹倾泻到目标身上。这种火力自然以高后坐力为代价，连射时极难控制。\n"
"\n"
"建议新手玩家在熟练掌握之前避免使用此武器。\n"
"\n"
"经过改装可发射穿甲弹，进一步提升了其作为武器系统的效能。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000097
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000098
msgid ""
"A general purpose machine gun used by the West German armed forces. It is a modified version of the vaunted WW2-era MG42, with a refurbished chamber to accommodate standard post-war ammunition.\n"
"\n"
"The MG3's high rate of fire allows the user to pump dozens of bullets into a target at once. This firepower naturally comes at the price of high recoil, making it extremely hard to control during repeat fire.\n"
"\n"
"Novice players are advised to avoid this weapon until they are skilled enough to handle it.\n"
"\n"
"This model is furnished with an improved magazine that augments its ammo capacity, giving it long-lasting repeat fire capability to match its power."
msgstr ""
"西德武装部队使用的通用机枪。它是二战时期备受赞誉的MG42的改进型，弹膛经过翻新以适配战后标准弹药。\n"
"\n"
"MG3的高射速能让使用者瞬间将数十发子弹倾泻到目标身上。这种火力自然以高后坐力为代价，连射时极难控制。\n"
"\n"
"建议新手玩家在熟练掌握之前避免使用此武器。\n"
"\n"
"此型号配备了改进型弹匣，提升了弹药容量，使其具备与其威力相称的持久连射能力。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000099
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00009b
msgid ""
"An unholy terror of a weapon that spits out thousands of bullets per minute from its six rotating barrels.\n"
"\n"
"Its destructive power is the stuff of legend. However, the system's enormous weight makes handling it a nightmare.\n"
"\n"
"If you think power is everything, then this is the gun you've been looking for."
msgstr ""
"一件每分钟从六根旋转枪管中喷出数千发子弹的恐怖武器。\n"
"\n"
"其破坏力堪称传奇。然而，系统巨大的重量使其操作起来如同噩梦。\n"
"\n"
"如果你认为威力就是一切，那这就是你一直在寻找的枪。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00009a
msgid ""
"A device that generates multiple electromagnetic waves which cross paths with each other. The resulting interference creates a concentrated burst of energy that instantaneously heats and expands the surrounding air, resulting in a powerful explosive effect.\n"
"\n"
"Its power is undeniable, but it cannot be used alone. Make sure to bring a CO-OPS teammate with you when carrying it into battle."
msgstr ""
"一种产生多道相互交叉的电磁波的装置。由此产生的干涉形成集中的能量爆发，瞬间加热并膨胀周围空气，产生强大的爆炸效果。\n"
"\n"
"其威力毋庸置疑，但无法单独使用。携带它参战时务必带上合作任务队友。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00009f
msgid ""
"A modified version of the M1 rifle carried by U.S. infantrymen and Marines during the Second World War, adapted for use as a sniper rifle.  Zoom can be adjusted.\n"
"\n"
"While not nearly as accurate as a true sniper rifle, it makes up for this shortcoming with its high rate of fire."
msgstr ""
"二战期间美国步兵和海军陆战队员所持M1步枪的改进型，改装为狙击步枪使用。可调节缩放。\n"
"\n"
"虽然精度远不及真正的狙击步枪，但凭借高射速弥补了这一不足。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000a0
msgid ""
"A modified version of the M1 rifle carried by U.S. infantrymen and Marines during the Second World War, adapted for use as a sniper rifle.\n"
"\n"
"While not nearly as accurate as a true sniper rifle, it makes up for this shortcoming with its high rate of fire.\n"
"\n"
"It also features a scope with three levels of zoom, which allows the user to match the magnification to the target distance and boosts the gun's potential as a sniping weapon."
msgstr ""
"二战期间美国步兵和海军陆战队员所持M1步枪的改进型，改装为狙击步枪使用。\n"
"\n"
"虽然精度远不及真正的狙击步枪，但凭借高射速弥补了这一不足。\n"
"\n"
"它还配备了三档缩放瞄准镜，让使用者能根据目标距离调整倍率，提升了其作为狙击武器的潜力。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000a1
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000a2
msgid ""
"A modified version of the M1 rifle carried by U.S. infantrymen and Marines during the Second World War, adapted for use as a sniper rifle.  Offers 3 levels of zoom.\n"
"\n"
"While not nearly as accurate as a true sniper rifle, it makes up for this shortcoming with its high rate of fire.\n"
"\n"
"This model has been modified to fire special \"PSYCHE Recovery Rounds\" that restore the PSYCHE of the target.\n"
"\n"
"This modification enables the user to provide effective combat support to CO-OPS teammates from long distances. You can't go wrong with this weapon in CO-OPS play."
msgstr ""
"二战期间美国步兵和海军陆战队员所持M1步枪的改进型，改装为狙击步枪使用。提供三档缩放。\n"
"\n"
"虽然精度远不及真正的狙击步枪，但凭借高射速弥补了这一不足。\n"
"\n"
"此型号经过改装可发射特殊的“精神恢复弹”，能恢复目标的精神。\n"
"\n"
"这一改装使使用者能从远距离为合作任务队友提供有效的战斗支援。在合作任务中使用此武器绝不会出错。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000a3
msgid ""
"A customized sniper rifle version of the M14, predecessor of the M16 as the U.S. military's standard assault rifle.\n"
"\n"
"The M21 takes the M14, already known for its superb accuracy, and makes it even better through accuracy-boosting sniper rifle modifications.\n"
"\n"
"In addition to its high precision, the M21 is equipped with a 3-level zoom scope to assist in targeting at various distances. Moreover, it fires armor-piercing rounds that can take even a well-protected foe down from a distance with a single headshot straight through the helmet."
msgstr ""
"M14的定制狙击步枪版本，M14是M16之前美军的标准突击步枪。\n"
"\n"
"M21将本就以精准著称的M14，通过提升精度的狙击步枪改装变得更加出色。\n"
"\n"
"除了高精度外，M21还配备三档缩放瞄准镜，协助应对各种距离的目标。此外，它发射穿甲弹，能从远距离一枪爆头穿透头盔击倒即使防护严密的敌人。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000a4
msgid ""
"A customized sniper rifle version of the M14, predecessor of the M16 as the U.S. military's standard assault rifle.\n"
"\n"
"The M21 takes the M14, already known for its superb accuracy, and makes it even better through accuracy-boosting sniper rifle modifications.\n"
"\n"
"In addition to its high precision, the M21 is equipped with a 3-level zoom scope to assist in targeting at various distances. Moreover, it fires armor-piercing rounds that can take even a well-protected foe down from a distance with a single headshot straight through the helmet.\n"
"\n"
"This model features a shorter barrel, which results in slightly higher recoil but makes it much easier to handle and carry, qualities that make it a solid weapon for scouts."
msgstr ""
"M14的定制狙击步枪版本，M14是M16之前美军的标准突击步枪。\n"
"\n"
"M21将本就以精准著称的M14，通过提升精度的狙击步枪改装变得更加出色。\n"
"\n"
"除了高精度外，M21还配备三档缩放瞄准镜，协助应对各种距离的目标。此外，它发射穿甲弹，能从远距离一枪爆头穿透头盔击倒即使防护严密的敌人。\n"
"\n"
"此型号采用较短枪管，后坐力略高但更易操作和携带，这些特性使其成为侦察兵的可靠武器。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000a5
msgid ""
"A customized sniper rifle version of the M14, predecessor of the M16 as the U.S. military's standard assault rifle.\n"
"\n"
"The M21 takes the M14, already known for its superb accuracy, and makes it even better through accuracy-boosting sniper rifle modifications.\n"
"\n"
"In addition to its high precision, the M21 is equipped with a 3-level zoom scope to assist in targeting at various distances. Moreover, it fires armor-piercing rounds that can take even a well-protected foe down from a distance with a single headshot straight through the helmet.\n"
"\n"
"Equipped with a limited-use suppressor. The suppressor will eventually wear out, so use it prudently."
msgstr ""
"M14的定制狙击步枪版本，M14是M16之前美军的标准突击步枪。\n"
"\n"
"M21将本就以精准著称的M14，通过提升精度的狙击步枪改装变得更加出色。\n"
"\n"
"除了高精度外，M21还配备三档缩放瞄准镜，协助应对各种距离的目标。此外，它发射穿甲弹，能从远距离一枪爆头穿透头盔击倒即使防护严密的敌人。\n"
"\n"
"配备有限次使用的消音器。消音器最终会磨损，请谨慎使用。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000a6
msgid ""
"An extensively modified version of the original M700 bolt-action hunting rifle, reborn as a military sniper rifle.\n"
"\n"
"It is sturdy and dependable thanks to its simple construction, and while limited to single shot fire, few weapons can match it in terms of accuracy.\n"
"\n"
"The M700 has a 3-level zoom scope and fires armor-piercing rounds; as such, it is geared more or less completely toward long-range precision sniping. \n"
"\n"
"An outstanding weapon for sniper duels or for teammate support in CO-OPS."
msgstr ""
"原版M700栓动猎枪经过大幅改装，重生为军用狙击步枪。\n"
"\n"
"结构简单使其坚固可靠，虽然仅限单发射击，但精度鲜有武器能及。\n"
"\n"
"M700配备三档缩放瞄准镜并发射穿甲弹；因此它几乎完全面向远距离精准狙击。\n"
"\n"
"狙击对决或合作任务中支援队友的出色武器。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000a7
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000a8
msgid ""
"An extensively modified version of the original M700 bolt-action hunting rifle, reborn as a military sniper rifle.\n"
"\n"
"It is sturdy and dependable thanks to its simple construction, and while limited to single shot fire, few weapons can match it in terms of accuracy.\n"
"\n"
"The M700 has a 3-level zoom scope and fire armor-piercing rounds; as such, it is geared more or less completely toward long-range precision sniping. \n"
"\n"
"An outstanding weapon for sniper duels or for teammate support in CO-OPS.\n"
"\n"
"This model has been fitted with a heavier bull barrel that reduces muzzle jump."
msgstr ""
"原版M700栓动猎枪经过大幅改装，重生为军用狙击步枪。\n"
"\n"
"结构简单使其坚固可靠，虽然仅限单发射击，但精度鲜有武器能及。\n"
"\n"
"M700配备三档缩放瞄准镜并发射穿甲弹；因此它几乎完全面向远距离精准狙击。\n"
"\n"
"狙击对决或合作任务中支援队友的出色武器。\n"
"\n"
"此型号装配了更重的加厚枪管，减少了枪口跳动。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000a9
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000aa
msgid ""
"An extensively modified version of the original M700 bolt-action hunting rifle, reborn as a military sniper rifle.\n"
"\n"
"It is sturdy and dependable thanks to its simple construction, and while limited to single shot fire, few weapons can match it in terms of accuracy.\n"
"Has a 3-level zoom scope. \n"
"\n"
"This model has been modified to fire special \"LIFE Recovery Rounds\" that restore the LIFE of the target. If you're looking for a way to restore your teammates' LIFE from a distance in CO-OPS play, look no further."
msgstr ""
"原版M700栓动猎枪经过大幅改装，重生为军用狙击步枪。\n"
"\n"
"结构简单使其坚固可靠，虽然仅限单发射击，但精度鲜有武器能及。\n"
"配备三档缩放瞄准镜。\n"
"\n"
"此型号经过改装可发射特殊的“生命恢复弹”，能恢复目标的生命值。如果你想在合作任务中从远距离恢复队友的生命值，不用再找了。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000ab
msgid ""
"A Russian-made bolt-action rifle. It originated as the main infantry rifle of Czarist Russia and saw considerable action in the Second World War as the \"long spear\" of Red Army snipers. It was also the preferred weapon of The End, the Cobra Unit's aged sniper.\n"
"\n"
"Has a 2-level zoom scope.\n"
"The Mosin-Nagant is not terribly accurate and has a low rate of fire; its appeal lies in its ability to fire special tranquilizer rounds that put targets to sleep.\n"
"\n"
"An absolute must-have for players who want a no-kill completion without having to get close to the enemy."
msgstr ""
"俄制栓动步枪。它最初是沙俄的主要步兵步枪，在二战中作为红军狙击手的“长矛”大显身手。它也是眼镜蛇部队年迈狙击手终焉的首选武器。\n"
"\n"
"配备两档缩放瞄准镜。\n"
"莫辛-纳甘精度不算高且射速低；其魅力在于能发射特殊的麻醉弹使目标入睡。\n"
"\n"
"对于想在不接近敌人的情况下完成零击杀通关的玩家来说，这是绝对必备之物。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000ac
msgid ""
"A Russian-made bolt-action rifle. It originated as the main infantry rifle of Czarist Russia and saw considerable action in the Second World War as the \"long spear\" of Red Army snipers. It was also the preferred weapon of The End, the Cobra Unit's aged sniper.\n"
"\n"
"The Mosin-Nagant is not terribly accurate and has a low rate of fire; its appeal lies in its ability to fire special tranquilizer rounds that put targets to sleep.\n"
"\n"
"An absolute must-have for players who want a no-kill completion without having to get close to the enemy.\n"
"\n"
"This model has been fitted with a 3-level zoom scope, making it easier to adjust the zoom level to match the target distance."
msgstr ""
"俄制栓动步枪。它最初是沙俄的主要步兵步枪，在二战中作为红军狙击手的“长矛”大显身手。它也是眼镜蛇部队年迈狙击手终焉的首选武器。\n"
"\n"
"莫辛-纳甘精度不算高且射速低；其魅力在于能发射特殊的麻醉弹使目标入睡。\n"
"\n"
"对于想在不接近敌人的情况下完成零击杀通关的玩家来说，这是绝对必备之物。\n"
"\n"
"此型号装配了三档缩放瞄准镜，更易根据目标距离调整缩放级别。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000ad
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000ae
msgid ""
"A Russian-made bolt-action rifle. It originated as the main infantry rifle of Czarist Russia and saw considerable action in the Second World War as the \"long spear\" of Red Army snipers. It was also the preferred weapon of The End, the Cobra Unit's aged sniper.\n"
"\n"
"The Mosin-Nagant is not terribly accurate and has a low rate of fire; its appeal lies in its ability to fire special tranquilizer rounds that put targets to sleep.\n"
"\n"
"An absolute must-have for players who want a no-kill completion without having to get close to the enemy.\n"
"\n"
"Its stock has also been replaced with a skeleton model, making it slightly lighter."
msgstr ""
"俄制栓动步枪。它最初是沙俄的主要步兵步枪，在二战中作为红军狙击手的“长矛”大显身手。它也是眼镜蛇部队年迈狙击手终焉的首选武器。\n"
"\n"
"莫辛-纳甘精度不算高且射速低；其魅力在于能发射特殊的麻醉弹使目标入睡。\n"
"\n"
"对于想在不接近敌人的情况下完成零击杀通关的玩家来说，这是绝对必备之物。\n"
"\n"
"其枪托也换成了骨架式，使其略轻。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000af
msgid ""
"A Russian-made bolt-action rifle. It originated as the main infantry rifle of Czarist Russia and saw considerable action in the Second World War as the \"long spear\" of Red Army snipers. It was also the preferred weapon of The End, the Cobra Unit's aged sniper.\n"
"\n"
"The Mosin-Nagant is not terribly accurate and has a low rate of fire; its appeal lies in its ability to fire special tranquilizer rounds that put targets to sleep.\n"
"\n"
"An absolute must-have for players who want a no-kill completion without having to get close to the enemy.\n"
"\n"
"Equipped with a suppressor, making this the ultimate no-kill completion weapon."
msgstr ""
"俄制栓动步枪。它最初是沙俄的主要步兵步枪，在二战中作为红军狙击手的“长矛”大显身手。它也是眼镜蛇部队年迈狙击手终焉的首选武器。\n"
"\n"
"莫辛-纳甘精度不算高且射速低；其魅力在于能发射特殊的麻醉弹使目标入睡。\n"
"\n"
"对于想在不接近敌人的情况下完成零击杀通关的玩家来说，这是绝对必备之物。\n"
"\n"
"配备消音器，使其成为零击杀通关的终极武器。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000b0
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000b1
msgid "The primary sniper rifle of the modern-day Soviet military. Since it was originally developed for the purpose of infantry squad support at medium range, its accuracy is nothing special compared to other sniper rifles. That said, its light weight and ease of use, three-level zoom scope, armor-piercing ammunition, and repeat fire capability make the SVD a force to be reckoned with in battle."
msgstr "现代苏联军队的主要狙击步枪。由于它最初是为中距离步兵班支援而研发，其精度与其他狙击步枪相比并无特别之处。尽管如此，其轻重量和易用性、三档缩放瞄准镜、穿甲弹药以及连射能力，使SVD在战斗中成为一股不可小觑的力量。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000b2
msgid ""
"The primary sniper rifle of the modern-day Soviet military. Since it was originally developed for the purpose of infantry squad support at medium range, its accuracy is nothing special compared to other sniper rifles. Nevertheless, its light weight and ease of use, multi-level zoom scope, armor-piercing ammunition, and repeat fire capability make the SVD a force to be reckoned with in battle.\n"
"\n"
"Modified to accommodate a new, larger capacity magazine. This results in fewer reloads and allows for more efficient use in combat."
msgstr ""
"现代苏联军队的主要狙击步枪。由于它最初是为中距离步兵班支援而研发，其精度与其他狙击步枪相比并无特别之处。尽管如此，其轻重量和易用性、多档缩放瞄准镜、穿甲弹药以及连射能力，使SVD在战斗中成为一股不可小觑的力量。\n"
"\n"
"经过改装以适配新的更大容量弹匣。这减少了装弹次数，使其在战斗中更高效。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000b3
msgid ""
"The primary sniper rifle of the modern-day Soviet military. Since it was originally developed for the purpose of infantry squad support at medium range, its accuracy is nothing special compared to other sniper rifles. That said, its light weight and ease of use, multi-level zoom scope, armor-piercing ammunition, and repeat fire capability make the SVD a force to be reckoned with in battle.\n"
"\n"
"The addition of night vision capability to the scope ensures this model is almost as deadly in the dark as it is in the light."
msgstr ""
"现代苏联军队的主要狙击步枪。由于它最初是为中距离步兵班支援而研发，其精度与其他狙击步枪相比并无特别之处。尽管如此，其轻重量和易用性、多档缩放瞄准镜、穿甲弹药以及连射能力，使SVD在战斗中成为一股不可小觑的力量。\n"
"\n"
"瞄准镜增加了夜视功能，确保此型号在黑暗中几乎与在光明中一样致命。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000b4
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000b5
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000b6
msgid ""
"A new model of sniper rifle developed to withstand the rigors of Special Forces operations in a world where unconventional warfare is becoming the norm.\n"
"\n"
"The WA2000 is heavy and extremely unwieldy, but compensates for this with low recoil, which gives it exceptional accuracy. Its scope has three levels of zoom to allow targeting at multiple distances, and armor-piercing ammunition makes it an effective weapon against heavily armored enemy troops even at long range.\n"
"\n"
"If long-range sniping battles are your thing, you can't go wrong with this gun."
msgstr ""
"一款新型狙击步枪，为在非常规战争日益常态化的世界中承受特种部队行动的严苛考验而研发。\n"
"\n"
"WA2000沉重且极不灵便，但以低后坐力弥补，从而具备出色的精度。其瞄准镜有三档缩放，可应对多种距离的目标，穿甲弹药使其即使在远距离也能有效对付重装甲敌军。\n"
"\n"
"如果你喜欢远距离狙击战，这把枪绝不会让你失望。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000b7
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000b8
msgid ""
"An anti-tank rifle adopted by the Soviet military in 1941. It is extremely large, heavy and powerful, but also incredibly difficult to handle, and so probably best left behind for sneaking missions.\n"
"\n"
"That said, its ammunition is so powerful it makes most sniper rifles look weak by comparison, easily punching through thick armor even at a considerable distance. A good weapon to have on hand when the situation calls for overwhelming force."
msgstr ""
"苏联军方于1941年采用的反坦克步枪。它极其巨大、沉重且威力强大，但也极难操作，因此潜行任务中最好还是别带上它。\n"
"\n"
"话虽如此，其弹药威力之大令大多数狙击步枪相形见绌，即使在相当远的距离也能轻易击穿厚装甲。当情况需要压倒性火力时，这是一把值得随身携带的好武器。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000b9
msgid ""
"An anti-tank rifle that uses the same ammo as the PTRD.\n"
"\n"
"Basically the same weapon as the PTRD, but with repeat fire capability, making it the most powerful sniper rifle you'll ever see.\n"
"\n"
"When the mission calls for firepower above all else, accept no substitutes."
msgstr ""
"使用与PTRD相同弹药的反坦克步枪。\n"
"\n"
"基本上与PTRD相同，但具备连射能力，使其成为你见过的最强大的狙击步枪。\n"
"\n"
"当任务要求火力至上时，别无替代。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000ba
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000bb
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000bc
msgid ""
"An electromagnetic accelerator cannon currently being researched throughout the developed world. It fires projectiles with a kinetic energy of over 10 megajoules, on par with those of a tank cannon.\n"
"\n"
"Naturally, this makes the rail gun orders of magnitude more powerful than anything else, able to destroy almost any target in a single shot. On the other hand, it also consumes an enormous amount of electricity, making it essential to have a CO-OPS teammate nearby to charge the weapon between shots."
msgstr ""
"目前发达国家正在研发的电磁加速炮。它发射的弹丸动能超过10兆焦耳，与坦克炮相当。\n"
"\n"
"自然，这使轨道炮的威力比其他任何武器都高出数个数量级，能一枪摧毁几乎任何目标。另一方面，它也消耗巨量电力，因此身边必须有合作任务队友在射击间隙为其充电。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000bd
msgid ""
"A remote charging system for the rail gun, employing an experimental microwave power transmission mechanism under development in several countries.\n"
"\n"
"This device is absolutely essential in order for the rail gun to unleash its full power. When using the rail gun in CO-OPS play, make sure somebody on the team has one."
msgstr ""
"轨道炮的远程充电系统，采用多个国家正在研发的实验性微波电力传输机制。\n"
"\n"
"此装置是轨道炮发挥全部威力的绝对必需品。在合作任务中使用轨道炮时，务必确保队伍中有人携带。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000cc
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000cd
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000ce
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000cf
msgid ""
"A disposable rocket launcher developed to give infantry a means of attacking hard targets such as light armored vehicles and bunkers. It is light and compact enough for a soldier to carry several at once without being slowed down.\n"
"\n"
"The LAW rocket packs quite a punch for such a small package; a single shot can take an entire pack of enemies in one fell swoop.\n"
"\n"
"When using the LAW, keep an eye on your remaining stock, as each launcher is good for only one use."
msgstr ""
"一种一次性火箭筒，为步兵提供攻击轻型装甲车和碉堡等硬目标的手段。它轻便小巧，士兵可同时携带数具而不影响行动。\n"
"\n"
"LAW火箭弹虽小威力却大，一发即可将整群敌人一举消灭。\n"
"\n"
"使用时请留意剩余数量，每具发射器仅可使用一次。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000d0
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000d1
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000d2
msgid ""
"A rocket launcher loaded with four rockets that can be fired one after another, allowing the user to deliver massive firepower in a hurry. \n"
"\n"
"On the down side, its weight and bulk make it quite awkward to handle. As such, it is probably best used to provide supporting fire from a distance. "
msgstr ""
"一种装填四发火箭弹、可连续发射的火箭筒，能让使用者迅速倾泻强大火力。\n"
"\n"
"缺点是重量和体积使其操作相当笨拙。因此最好用于远距离支援射击。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000d3
msgid ""
"A man-portable, rocket-propelled grenade launcher, modeled after the \"Panzerfaust\" anti-tank weapon employed by the armies of Nazi Germany.\n"
"\n"
"The RPG2 is a high-risk, high-return weapon: the grenades tend to miss moving targets, but their sheer power ensures they do considerable damage when they do hit their mark.\n"
"\n"
"Reload time is also reasonable, so the grenades can be fired in relatively rapid succession. Definitely worth a look if you've got a steady aim."
msgstr ""
"一种单兵便携式火箭推进榴弹发射器，仿制纳粹德军使用的\"铁拳\"反坦克武器。\n"
"\n"
"RPG2是一款高风险高回报的武器：榴弹容易打偏移动目标，但威力巨大，一旦命中便能造成可观伤害。\n"
"\n"
"装填时间也较为合理，可相对快速地连续发射。若你瞄准稳定，绝对值得一试。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000d4
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000d5
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000d6
msgid ""
"The successor to the RPG2, produced and deployed in large numbers as the primary anti-tank weapon for infantry in the Soviet Union and its satellite states. Needless to say, it is highly effective against personnel as well as tanks.\n"
"\n"
"The grenades contain a more powerful warhead than those of the RPG2, but suffer from the same low accuracy. The secret to getting the most out of the RPG7 in battle is to get up close and personal with the enemy and aim your shots carefully.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"RPG2的后继型号，作为苏联及其卫星国步兵的主力反坦克武器被大量生产和部署。不用说，它对人员和坦克都极为有效。\n"
"\n"
"其弹头比RPG2的威力更强，但同样存在精度低的问题。在战斗中充分发挥RPG7威力的秘诀就是贴近敌人并仔细瞄准射击。\n"
"\n"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000d7
msgid ""
"A man-portable, disposable surface-to-air missile launcher.\n"
"\n"
"While not necessarily all it could be performance-wise, it does provide infantry with excellent anti-air capabilities and is now widely used in the U.S. and throughout the free world.\n"
"\n"
"The missiles use a passive infrared guidance system, making them the perfect weapon to counter airstrikes by attack choppers. If you're going to be facing enemy aircraft in a mission, you can't go wrong with the FIM-43."
msgstr ""
"一种单兵便携式一次性地对空导弹发射器。\n"
"\n"
"虽然性能未必尽善尽美，但它为步兵提供了出色的防空能力，如今在美国及整个自由世界广泛使用。\n"
"\n"
"导弹采用被动红外制导系统，是应对攻击直升机空袭的绝佳武器。若任务中会遭遇敌机，FIM-43绝不会让你失望。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000d8
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000d9
msgid ""
"A man-portable surface-to-air missile system, developed as the successor to the FIM-43. The launcher is disposable and good for only one shot.\n"
"\n"
"It is a very easy to use anti-air weapon. The missiles feature an improved guidance system with dual infrared and ultraviolet seekers. An enhanced seeker cooling system also shortens pre-launch lock-on time, which allows for quicker responses to unexpected engagements with the enemy.\n"
"\n"
"Players who find themselves struggling to cope with enemy air attacks are strongly advised to bring a XFIM-92A or two along.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"一种便携式地对空导弹系统，作为FIM-43的后继型号开发。发射器为一次性使用，只能发射一发。\n"
"\n"
"这是一种非常易于使用的防空武器。导弹配备了改进的制导系统，采用红外和紫外双模导引头。增强的导引头冷却系统还缩短了发射前的锁定时间，从而能够更快地应对与敌人的突发交战。\n"
"\n"
"如果玩家觉得难以应对敌方空袭，强烈建议携带一两个XFIM-92A。\n"
"\n"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000da
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000db
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000dc
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000dd
msgid ""
"A man-portable, recoilless rifle that fires potent 84mm shells. It employs the Krupp firing system, which vents the propellant gas out the rear of the gun to eliminate recoil.\n"
"\n"
"The Carl Gustav M2 is distinguished by its high initial muzzle velocity, which gives its projectiles a lower, straighter trajectory and improves its accuracy compared to other rocket launchers.\n"
"\n"
"On the down side, it is structured such that reloading can be a chore, making it unsuitable for repeat fire. Thus, the most effective way to use this weapon is to aim carefully and ensure the target is destroyed in one shot."
msgstr ""
"一种单兵便携式无后坐力炮，发射威力强大的84毫米炮弹。它采用克虏伯发射系统，将推进气体从炮尾排出以消除后坐力。\n"
"\n"
"卡尔·古斯塔夫M2以高初速著称，弹道更低更直，精度优于其他火箭发射器。\n"
"\n"
"缺点是装填结构繁琐，不适合连续射击。因此最有效的用法是仔细瞄准，确保一击摧毁目标。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000de
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000df
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000e0
msgid ""
"A man-portable recoilless rifle that fires potent 84mm shells. It employs the Krupp firing system, which vents the propellant gas out the rear of the gun to eliminate recoil.\n"
"\n"
"The Carl Gustav M2 is distinguished by its high initial muzzle velocity, which gives its projectiles a lower, straighter trajectory and improves its accuracy compared to other rocket launchers.\n"
"\n"
"This model has been modified to launch multipurpose HEAT rounds. The controlled fragments are distributed in an improved pattern, expanding the area of effect but decreasing the damage dealt to each individual target. As a result, it is best used for wiping out large crowds of enemy infantry."
msgstr ""
"一种单兵便携式无后坐力炮，发射威力强大的84毫米炮弹。它采用克虏伯发射系统，将推进气体从炮尾排出以消除后坐力。\n"
"\n"
"卡尔·古斯塔夫M2以高初速著称，弹道更低更直，精度优于其他火箭发射器。\n"
"\n"
"此型号经过改装，可发射多用途破甲弹。受控破片分布更佳，扩大了作用范围但降低了对单个目标的伤害。因此最适合用来消灭大群敌方步兵。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000e1
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000e2
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000e3
msgid ""
"A man-portable recoilless rifle that fires potent 84mm shells. It employs the Krupp firing system, which vents the propellant gas out the rear of the gun to eliminate recoil.\n"
"The Carl Gustav M2 is distinguished by its high initial muzzle velocity, which gives its projectiles a lower, straighter trajectory and improves its accuracy compared to other rocket launchers.\n"
"\n"
"This model has been modified to launch shells filled with sleeping gas as well as Fulton recovery balloons, allowing the user to perform Fulton recoveries from a relatively safe distance. Good for players who want to recruit new teammates but don't want to come out and face the enemy themselves. "
msgstr ""
"一种单兵便携式无后坐力炮，发射威力强大的84毫米炮弹。它采用克虏伯发射系统，将推进气体从炮尾排出以消除后坐力。\n"
"卡尔·古斯塔夫M2以高初速著称，弹道更低更直，精度优于其他火箭发射器。\n"
"\n"
"此型号经过改装，可发射填充催眠瓦斯和富尔顿回收气球的炮弹，让使用者能在相对安全的距离进行富尔顿回收。适合想招募新队友却不愿亲自面对敌人的玩家。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000e4
msgid ""
"A state-of-the-art, man-portable anti-tank missile that just recently entered service in the U.S. military. The launcher is disposable and good for only one shot.\n"
"\n"
"The M47 employs an optical, wired guidance system with excellent seeking capabilities. Its warhead is also among the most powerful in its class, capable of blowing almost any target to smithereens.\n"
"\n"
"If you think the enemy is going to be tough to take down, don't think twice about taking the M47 along with you.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"一种最先进的便携式反坦克导弹，最近才在美国军队中服役。发射器为一次性使用，只能发射一发。\n"
"\n"
"M47采用光学有线制导系统，具有出色的寻的能力。其弹头也是同类中最强大的之一，几乎能将任何目标炸成碎片。\n"
"\n"
"如果你觉得敌人难以对付，别犹豫，带上M47吧。\n"
"\n"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000e5
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000e6
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000e7
msgid ""
"A unique weapon that effectively renders the target optically invisible. The result of the combined efforts of the entire Mother Base R&D Team.\n"
"\n"
"Because of its large size, it cannot be operated without the assistance of CO-OPS teammates, so be careful not to take it along on solo missions."
msgstr ""
"一种独特武器，能有效使目标光学隐形。这是母基地研发团队全体努力的成果。\n"
"\n"
"由于体积庞大，没有合作任务队友协助便无法操作，因此注意不要单独执行任务时携带。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000e8
msgid "One of the structural elements of the human slingshot, the ultimate CO-OP weapon. With enough mechanical strength to withstand the rigors of the giant rubber band that comes with it, it also makes a fine club for beating down the enemy."
msgstr "人体弹弓的结构部件之一，终极合作武器。其机械强度足以承受随附巨型橡皮筋的拉力，也可当作上好的棍棒痛击敌人。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000e9
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000ea
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000eb
msgid ""
"One of the structural elements of the human slingshot, the ultimate CO-OP weapon. This rubber band is incredibly powerful and can launch a brawny 200-pound soldier a considerable distance.\n"
"\n"
"The power of the launch depends on how rapidly the button is tapped. Players with weak thumbs may want to practice their button mashing skills before attempting to use this weapon."
msgstr ""
"人类弹弓的结构部件之一，终极CO-OP武器。这条橡皮筋威力惊人，能将一名体重200磅的壮汉士兵弹射到相当远的距离。\n"
"\n"
"弹射的力度取决于按键的速度。拇指无力的玩家在尝试使用这件武器前，或许应该先练习一下连打技巧。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000f8
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000f9
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000fa
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000fb
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000fc
msgid ""
"A standard fragmentation grenade. It deals damage with the force of its blast and the shrapnel it scatters.\n"
"\n"
"Exceptionally powerful versus human targets - most enemy soldiers will go down in a single blast.\n"
"\n"
"Getting a grenade to land where you want it to takes some practice, so be sure to get some practice throws in when you can spare the time."
msgstr ""
"一种标准破片手榴弹。它通过爆炸的冲击力和散射的弹片造成伤害。\n"
"\n"
"对人类目标威力极强——大多数敌方士兵会被一次爆炸击倒。\n"
"\n"
"让手榴弹落在你想要的位置需要一些练习，所以有空的时候一定要练练投掷。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000fd
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000fe
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x0000ff
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000100
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000101
msgid ""
"A non-lethal weapon filled with a magnesium-based explosive. When it detonates, it emits a blinding flash of light, an ear-splitting bang, and an intense shockwave that combine to knock targets unconscious.\n"
"\n"
"Keep in mind, however, that those same effects also work on the user. Make sure you're safely behind cover or facing the other way when the grenade goes off."
msgstr ""
"一种非致命武器，内装镁基炸药。引爆时会发出刺眼的闪光、震耳欲聋的巨响和强烈的冲击波，共同作用使目标昏迷。\n"
"\n"
"但请记住，这些效果对使用者同样有效。手榴弹爆炸时，确保你安全地躲在掩体后或背对爆炸方向。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000102
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000103
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000104
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000105
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000106
msgid "A non-lethal weapon that scatters a cloud of metal strips when detonated, scrambling nearby electronic devices. When surrounded by unmanned weapons, a chaff grenade can turn the tables in an instant. The chaff can also temporarily block the user's own radio and sensor signals, so these grenades are best saved for when the time is right."
msgstr "一种非致命武器，引爆时会散布一团金属条，干扰附近的电子设备。当被无人武器包围时，箔条手榴弹可以瞬间扭转局势。箔条还会暂时阻断使用者自身的无线电和传感器信号，因此这些手榴弹最好留到合适的时机使用。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000107
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000108
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000109
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00010a
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00010b
msgid "A grenade that releases smoke when ignited. It does no physical damage. The smoke clouds the enemy's vision, which can be a godsend when the user needs to get out of sight quickly. Remember that the smoke makes it just as difficult for the user to see."
msgstr "一种点燃后释放烟雾的手榴弹。它不造成物理伤害。烟雾会遮蔽敌人的视线，当使用者需要迅速脱离视线时，这可能是天赐之物。请记住，烟雾同样会让使用者难以看清。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00010c
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00010d
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00010e
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00010f
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000110
msgid "A smoke grenade that releases colored smoke. Works exactly the same way as a regular smoke grenade. Available in a variety of colors for your convenience."
msgstr "一种释放彩色烟雾的烟雾弹。作用方式与普通烟雾弹完全相同。为方便起见，提供多种颜色可选。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000111
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000112
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000113
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000114
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000115
msgid ""
"A non-lethal grenade that releases sleeping gas when it detonates. Anyone who inhales the gas will fall asleep within a certain amount of time. Throwing multiple grenades will increase the potency of the gas and make targets fall asleep faster.\n"
"\n"
"Of course, the gas also affects the user, so make sure to throw the grenade a safe distance away."
msgstr ""
"一种非致命手榴弹，引爆时释放催眠气体。任何吸入气体的人都会在一定时间内入睡。投掷多枚手榴弹会增加气体的效力，使目标更快入睡。\n"
"\n"
"当然，气体也会影响使用者，所以确保将手榴弹投掷到安全距离外。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000116
msgid ""
"An empty ammo magazine. It is useless as a weapon, but it can be thrown to make a noise and thereby distract the enemy.\n"
"\n"
"Added to your inventory each time you reload a gun."
msgstr ""
"一个空弹匣。作为武器它毫无用处，但可以投掷出去发出声响，从而分散敌人的注意力。\n"
"\n"
"每次给枪械装弹时都会添加到你的物品栏中。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000117
msgid ""
"A marker for requesting support supplies from Mother Base. The marker indicates the location where the supplies are to be dropped. To use it, throw it the same way you would throw a grenade.\n"
"\n"
"Useful in missions where supplies are difficult to procure on site."
msgstr ""
"一种用于向Mother Base请求支援补给的标记。该标记指示补给投放的位置。使用方法与投掷手榴弹相同。\n"
"\n"
"在难以就地获取补给的任务中非常有用。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000118
msgid ""
"A marker for requesting support strikes from Mother Base. The marker indicates the location of the attack. To use it, throw it the same way you would throw a grenade.\n"
"\n"
"Use it to gain the upper hand in combat by taking advantage of Mother Base's firepower."
msgstr ""
"从母基地请求支援打击的标记。标记处即为攻击落点。用法与投掷手雷相同。\n"
"\n"
"善用母基地的火力，在战斗中占据上风。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000119
msgid ""
"A high-power electromagnetic net used to capture large enemy war machines.\n"
"\n"
"When activated, it generates a powerful magnetic field several teslas in magnitude, freezing enemy war machines in their tracks.\n"
"\n"
"While being able to capture enemy weapons without damaging them is great, each net can only be used once and they are too difficult to produce in large quantities, so be sure not to waste them. Make each one count."
msgstr ""
"用于捕获大型敌方战争机器的高功率电磁网。\n"
"\n"
"启动后会产生数特斯拉级的强磁场，让敌方战争机器动弹不得。\n"
"\n"
"能在不损伤敌方武器的前提下将其捕获固然好，但每张网只能用一次，且难以量产，切勿浪费。务必一击必中。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00011a
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00011b
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00011c
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00011d
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00011e
msgid ""
"A military-grade plastic explosive, employed by the U.S. military and other militaries worldwide.\n"
"\n"
"It has 1.34 times the destructive power of TNT and can be molded into virtually any shape.\n"
"\n"
"C4 is the most basic demolition tool in your arsenal. You're sure to find plenty of uses for it."
msgstr ""
"军用级塑性炸药，美军及全球多国军队均有装备。\n"
"\n"
"威力是TNT的1.34倍，可塑成任意形状。\n"
"\n"
"C4是你武器库中最基础的爆破工具，用途广泛。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00011f
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000120
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000121
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000122
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000123
msgid ""
"An anti-personnel mine that focuses its blast in a specific direction. Upon detonation, it sprays 700 steel balls across a 60-degree arc, Although developed for anti-personnel use, it is also effective against vehicles.\n"
"\n"
"The Claymore is extremely powerful and simple to use, but be very careful not to set it off yourself. The results could be too horrible to watch."
msgstr ""
"将爆炸威力集中于特定方向的杀伤人员地雷。引爆后会向60度扇面喷射700颗钢珠，虽为杀伤人员而开发，对车辆同样有效。\n"
"\n"
"阔剑威力极强、使用简单，但千万小心别引爆到自己。那场面可不堪入目。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000124
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000125
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000126
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000127
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000128
msgid ""
"A popular monthly magazine jam-packed with excitement on every page. It has a massive fan base that stretches all the way from the southern part of the U.S. to the Panama Canal, and a circulation of 1.1 million copies per month. One especially popular feature is the pen pal exchange page.\n"
"\n"
"Some CIA mercenaries and MSF members are known to be avid readers of this mag. Put it in front of them and they just might drop everything else..."
msgstr ""
"一本每页都精彩纷呈的月刊杂志。从美国南部到巴拿马运河都拥有庞大粉丝群，月发行量110万册。其中笔友交流栏目尤其受欢迎。\n"
"\n"
"据说部分CIA雇佣兵和MSF成员也是这本杂志的忠实读者。放到他们面前，说不定会放下手头一切..."

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00012e
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00012f
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000130
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000131
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000132
msgid ""
"A monthly cooking magazine, wildly popular among would-be gourmet chefs.\n"
"\n"
"This month's special feature focuses on a cooking show broadcast in over 20 countries worldwide and a runaway ratings hit.\n"
"\n"
"The magazine showcases a number of sumptuous recipes from the show with mouth-watering full-page color photos. Even a casual glance will leave you drooling.\n"
"\n"
"Whoever owned this copy apparently used it in the kitchen, as the rich aroma of food permeates every page. The scent might even be enough to attract some hungry wild animals..."
msgstr ""
"一本美食月刊，在向往成为美食家的人气极高。\n"
"\n"
"本月特辑聚焦一档在全球20多个国家播出的烹饪节目，收视率一路飙升。\n"
"\n"
"杂志刊登了节目中多道丰盛菜谱，配以令人垂涎的全彩大图。随便扫一眼都会让你口水直流。\n"
"\n"
"这本杂志的主人显然在厨房里用过它，每一页都浸透着浓郁的饭菜香。这香味甚至可能引来饥饿的野生动物……"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000133
msgid ""
"A weekly pulp magazine filled to the brim with outlandish and absurd sci-fi/horror stories.  Roughly half of the stories are about men fighting Martians and are written by amateurs.  Not to be taken too seriously.  Lurid and sexually suggestive themes are a given.\n"
msgstr ""
"满是离奇荒诞科幻恐怖故事的周刊廉价杂志。约半数是业余作者写的火星人战斗故事。不必太当真。低俗与性暗示内容自然少不了。\n"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000134
msgid "A monthly pulp magazine that features mature content aimed at literary types. The real-life travel logs submitted by soldiers from around the world are a must read.  Also boasts an ample supply of scantily-clad pin-ups."
msgstr "面向文学爱好者的成人向月刊廉价杂志。士兵们从世界各地寄来的真实旅行日志值得一读。也有大量衣着暴露的写真。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000135
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000137
msgid "A quarterly men's lifestyle magazine aimed at discriminating adults. Features include articles on news, politics, and special interests such as the ever-popular \"bonsai\" corner.  Naturally, it also features its fare share of \"adult content.\""
msgstr "面向有品位成年人的季刊男性生活杂志。内容包括新闻、政治，以及备受欢迎的“盆栽”专栏等。当然也少不了“成人内容”。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000136
msgid ""
"Bimonthly fashion magazine for women.\n"
"Features articles that satisfy the needs of women soldiers who want to look good even on the harshest of battlefields.\n"
"Pictorial spreads featuring lovely models in fashionable outfits have earned this periodical a strong following of male readers.\n"
"(photo by Famitsu Wave DVD)"
msgstr ""
"面向女性的双月刊时尚杂志。\n"
"内容满足女兵们即使在最严酷的战场上也想保持美丽的需求。\n"
"刊登身着时尚服饰的靓丽模特写真，为这本刊物赢得了大量男性读者。\n"
"(photo by Famitsu Wave DVD)"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000138
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000139
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00013a
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00013b
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00013c
msgid ""
"A potent anti-vehicle mine capable of dealing heavy damage to the undercarriage of a large vehicle. One solid direct hit can cause enemy vehicles to grind to a halt temporarily.\n"
"\n"
"An extremely valuable tool in combat against vehicles, but it takes a certain amount of weight to trigger it, rendering it ineffective against hovering vehicles.\n"
"\n"
"Consider what types of enemies you'll be facing before deciding to take this weapon into battle."
msgstr ""
"一种强力的反车辆地雷，能对大型车辆底盘造成重创。一次直接命中即可让敌方车辆暂时瘫痪。\n"
"\n"
"是对抗车辆的极宝贵工具，但需要一定重量才能触发，对悬浮车辆无效。\n"
"\n"
"决定带它上阵前，先想清楚会面对何种敌人。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00013d
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00013e
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00013f
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000140
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000141
msgid "A life-sized, man-shaped decoy made of wood. It can be used to distract the enemy's attention, but the enemy will see through it immediately when they get close enough. Don't expect to rely on it too much - it is, after all, just a piece of wood."
msgstr "一个真人大小的木制人形诱饵。可用来分散敌人注意力，但敌人靠近后立刻就会识破。别指望太依赖它——毕竟只是块木头。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000142
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000143
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000144
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000145
#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000146
msgid ""
"A self-detonating explosive charge that floats in midair using the same type of balloon as the Fulton recovery system, designed for aerial ambushes.\n"
"\n"
"It can be quite effective as a mine against helicopters and other craft that fly at a high altitude."
msgstr ""
"一种自爆式炸药，利用与富尔顿回收系统同款气球悬浮于半空，专为空中伏击设计。\n"
"\n"
"作为对付直升机等高空飞行器的地雷相当有效。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000148
msgid ""
"A non-lethal personnel recovery weapon that combines a sleeping gas release system with the Fulton recovery system.\n"
"\n"
"This is an incredibly handy tool to have - just plant it and watch it gather new recruits for you."
msgstr ""
"一种非致命人员回收武器，结合了催眠瓦斯释放系统与富尔顿回收系统。\n"
"\n"
"这是件极其便利的工具——只需布设，就能看着它为你招募新兵。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x000149
msgid ""
"A marker for requesting support supplies from Mother Base. The marker indicates the location where the supplies are to be dropped. To use it, plant it the same way you would plant a mine.\n"
"\n"
"Useful in missions where supplies are difficult to procure on site."
msgstr ""
"用于向母基地请求支援物资的标记。标记指示物资投放地点。使用方法与布设地雷相同。\n"
"\n"
"在难以就地获取物资的任务中很有用。"

#: slot/0x00edcb1e/0x017f53/0x00014a
msgid ""
"A marker for requesting support strikes from Mother Base. The marker indicates the location of the attack. To use it, plant it the same way you would plant a mine.\n"
"\n"
"Use it to gain the upper hand in combat by taking advantage of Mother Base's firepower."
msgstr ""
"用于向母基地请求支援打击的标记。标记指示攻击地点。使用方法与布设地雷相同。\n"
"\n"
"利用母基地的火力在战斗中占据上风。"

